cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project in research or engineering work, please cite it as below."
title: "Zynq LoRa PHY and Positioning: Reproducible SDR/FPGA Communication and TDoA Research Platform"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Lyubko"
    given-names: "Alexander"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Lay007/zynq-lora-phy"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - LoRa
  - CSS
  - software-defined radio
  - SDR
  - FPGA
  - Zynq
  - DSP
  - Verilog
  - fixed-point
  - time of arrival
  - ToA
  - time difference of arrival
  - TDoA
  - positioning
abstract: >-
  A reproducible engineering and research platform for LoRa-compatible PHY
  processing, fixed-point and generated-HDL implementation, precise packet
  time-of-arrival estimation, and calibrated TDoA positioning on Zynq-based
  software-defined radio hardware.
